  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e5/Soft_Candy.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022181449\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Soft Candy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Soft Candy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Soft Candy</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 20</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>halloweenh</span><span title=\"Halloween hat\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"halloweenh\"><img alt=\"halloweenh\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/c/c5/Halloween_Hat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20241021192419\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>20</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  10m</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 54</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Halloween Treats Maker</span><span title=\"Halloween treats maker\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/halloween-treats-maker-36156\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Soft Candy</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">product</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 20. It's a special item used only for the Halloween 2025 event.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, it is stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making Soft Candies</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/4b/Halloween_Treats_Maker.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021180133\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Halloween Treats Maker</figcaption></figure>\n<p>Soft Candy are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/halloween-treats-maker-36156\" title=\"Halloween Treats Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween Treats Maker</a>.\n</p><p>To make a soft candy in 2025, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/striped-candy-36441\" title=\"Striped Candy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Striped Candy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/cream-2315\" title=\"Cream\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cream\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 10 minutes to make a candy,and 5 minutes in a 1-star mastered station. Each balloon gives players 54 <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> points.\n</p><p>Additionally, Soft Candy is used to make the following <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/worm-treats-36171\" title=\"Worm treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Worm treats\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/worm-treats-36171\" title=\"Worm Treats\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Worm Treats</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e5/Soft_Candy.png/revision/latest?cb=20251022181449\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Soft Candy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 35\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest?cb=20150712182459\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Riverboat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Riverboat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Riverboat</figcaption></figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 1 to 2 candies per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat. Each candy used on a boat will be rewarded with 20 <a href=\"/wiki/halloween-hat-36167\" title=\"Halloween Hat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Halloween Hats</a>, 30 halloween hats in a 2-star and 40 halloween hats in a 3-star.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901031022\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 915/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3679/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 68/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 766200/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.078      1 -total\n 76.85%   43.862      1 Template:Infobox\n 32.44%   18.516      6 Template:Infoicon\n  9.63%    5.499      1 Template:Navigation\n  6.61%    3.770      1 Template:Item_Usage\n  3.53%    2.017      1 Template:Languages\n  2.67%    1.524      3 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:36442-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901031022 and revision id 108794. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
